Name Rio Note - Police #1 Parallel

Interactability_Text_Line_0 Commander Jorge,
Interactability_Text_Line_1 It has come to our attention that the situation in Rio de Janeiro has been deteriorating since criminal factions in the state began to coordinate under the so-called Southern Front, and have begun to act almost like a parallel force to law enforcement in some areas.
Interactability_Text_Line_2 While Ramagem's undercover operations have managed to apprehend several big names within these factions, they have failed to weaken said groups and have, in fact, resulted in closer coordination between them.
Interactability_Text_Line_3 State government has approved an increase in our budget so that we may expand our operations and bring these outlaws to justice. Additionally, thanks to your outstanding work within the force, you are hereby being selected to command our efforts with Federal forces towards dismantling these groups.
Interactability_Text_Line_4 Lastly, as you may now be aware, Daniel and Oliveira will take a paid leave for their marriage and honeymoon, and as such will become unavailable for the third week of August. Thusly, you will need to appoint a different pair of agents to lead the raid into Jaguarmen territory.